# ~1 GB of extracted features: reproducible from the two extraction scripts in a little
# over an hour, and both are cached so re-running is a no-op once present.
cache/
# Penultimate features of the from-scratch net, ~85 MB, reproducible from fewshot_train.py.
# The episode results themselves (fewshot_results.jls) are small and ARE tracked.
fewshot/*.f32
fewshot/*.i64
